.Dd 2026-05-30
.Dt NOMAD-LOGS 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm nomad-logs
.Nd tail container logs for a stack service
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm nomad logs
.Op Ar args ...
.Op Ar service ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
shows Docker Compose logs for the NOMAD stack.
.Pp
With no arguments it prints the last 100 lines of the
.Cm admin
service and exits.
.Pp
Any arguments are passed straight through to
.Ic docker compose logs ,
so you can follow a service, change the tail length, or name a different
service.
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Ic nomad logs
Snapshot the last 100 lines of the admin service.
.It Ic nomad logs -f admin
Follow the admin service log live.
.It Ic nomad logs --tail 500 mysql
Show the last 500 lines of the mysql service.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr nomad 1 ,
.Xr nomad-system 1
